dwijnen. In hun columns onderzoeken ze hoe zulke uitdrukkingen klonken, waar ze aan herinneren en wat ze nog kunnen oproepen. De verzameling richt zich op taal die in dialecten, oude gewoonten of persoonlijke herinneringen is blijven hangen. Met speelse observaties laten de auteurs zien hoe een vergeten woord opnieuw gebruikt kan worden en welke beelden daarmee terugkeren.","work_id":987144010,"evidence":[{"note":"VanLichtekooiEnZwiepkanarie DutchHardcover9789038806129 columns/lexicon byStellaBergsmaandSylviaWitteman. First2018physicalsource; KB2019printingkeptdistinct. Not ordinarydictionaryauthorlessorfictionnovel.","type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p424550857"],"reference":"new-work-dossier-readings-045.json#273","checked_at":"2026-11-03T09:13:56.273Z"},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","review":"content-review-013.json","sources":["https://www.wehkamp.nl/van-lichtekooi-en-zwiepkanarie-stella-bergsma-en-sylvia-witteman-16596994/","https://www.bol.com/be/nl/p/van-lichtekooi-en-zwiepkanarie/9200000095737364/","https://www.singeluitgeverijen.nl/auteur/sylvia-witteman/boeken/","https://openlibrary.org/works/OL43411630W","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p424550857"]},{"type":"explicit_contributor_roles","credits":[{"name":"Stella Bergsma","role":"joint text author","source":"https://www.singeluitgeverijen.nl/auteur/sylvia-witteman/boeken/"},{"name":"Sylvia Witteman","role":"joint text author","source":"https://www.singeluitgeverijen.nl/auteur/sylvia-witteman/boeken/"}],"limitation":"Existing schema has one primary Work author; no synthetic combined-author identity or author merge."},{"note":"Exactsource-coverattempt retained; noverifiedasset imported. Inspect actualsameeditionresolver or documentedneutralplaceholder hosted. No cross-editionlanguagecover replacement.","type":"no_verified_cover_asset_retained","isbn13":"9789038806129","status":"no_verified_asset_retained","attempts":[{"status":"bul